        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/47a20cc5a4af3ec252d62ba89c7ac9bf.avif?t=1789043920\" width=750 height=110 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/6b7bc73d725920d6e2431b5b7116234f.poster.avif?t=1789043920\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/6b7bc73d725920d6e2431b5b7116234f.webm?t=1789043920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/6b7bc73d725920d6e2431b5b7116234f.mp4?t=1789043920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story of Jake, who is retracing the footsteps of his father, a famous spelunker, and uncover family secrets as he descends deeper into the abyss of the caves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cheap jump scares - the main game fear factors are headlamp battery life and well… your nerves! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Horror Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/0f6701406503ede8f4fcf2aeb06d6107.poster.avif?t=1789043920\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/0f6701406503ede8f4fcf2aeb06d6107.webm?t=1789043920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/0f6701406503ede8f4fcf2aeb06d6107.mp4?t=1789043920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chilling experience designed to trigger your deepest phobias. Explore unpredictable cave systems where the darkness itself feels alive, facing a shifting variety of psychological and environmental horrors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Tourist Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/701bd2137ce0931b875a37a3ef4fc06a.poster.avif?t=1789043920\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/701bd2137ce0931b875a37a3ef4fc06a.webm?t=1789043920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/701bd2137ce0931b875a37a3ef4fc06a.mp4?t=1789043920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey through the infamous Nutty Putty cave, guided by an exclusive audio commentary from Brandon Kowallis, a real-life rescuer from the tragic 2009 incident and original cartographer who mapped its treacherous passages before they were closed forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Cave Layouts</strong>: Irregular, natural cave structures that avoid repetition or tiled environments. Expect steep climbs, narrow tunnels, and slides</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed Environmental Interaction</strong>: Players can move rocks, observe dripping water, and interact with reactive surroundings.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Built-in Map System</strong>: Players must mark trails with chalk, promoting true exploration and self-reliance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tool Management &amp; Gear Maintenance</strong>: Navigate the darkness using ropes and a headlamp. Maintain your gloves to ensure their reliability.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Climbing Mechanics</strong>: Climb any surface using pitons, choosing your own routes—no predefined climbing paths.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breath Management System</strong>: Manage your breathing in tight passages. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obstacle Interaction</strong>: Use tools to break stalactites, remove debris, and clear blockages in the cave system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/575329d10c27ba004f8d9c3bb7174240.avif?t=1789043920\" width=728 height=290 /></span></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/47a20cc5a4af3ec252d62ba89c7ac9bf.avif?t=1789043920\" width=750 height=110 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/6b7bc73d725920d6e2431b5b7116234f.poster.avif?t=1789043920\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/6b7bc73d725920d6e2431b5b7116234f.webm?t=1789043920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/6b7bc73d725920d6e2431b5b7116234f.mp4?t=1789043920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story of Jake, who is retracing the footsteps of his father, a famous spelunker, and uncover family secrets as he descends deeper into the abyss of the caves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cheap jump scares - the main game fear factors are headlamp battery life and well… your nerves! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Horror Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/0f6701406503ede8f4fcf2aeb06d6107.poster.avif?t=1789043920\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/0f6701406503ede8f4fcf2aeb06d6107.webm?t=1789043920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/0f6701406503ede8f4fcf2aeb06d6107.mp4?t=1789043920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chilling experience designed to trigger your deepest phobias. Explore unpredictable cave systems where the darkness itself feels alive, facing a shifting variety of psychological and environmental horrors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Tourist Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/701bd2137ce0931b875a37a3ef4fc06a.poster.avif?t=1789043920\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/701bd2137ce0931b875a37a3ef4fc06a.webm?t=1789043920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/701bd2137ce0931b875a37a3ef4fc06a.mp4?t=1789043920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey through the infamous Nutty Putty cave, guided by an exclusive audio commentary from Brandon Kowallis, a real-life rescuer from the tragic 2009 incident and original cartographer who mapped its treacherous passages before they were closed forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Cave Layouts</strong>: Irregular, natural cave structures that avoid repetition or tiled environments. Expect steep climbs, narrow tunnels, and slides</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed Environmental Interaction</strong>: Players can move rocks, observe dripping water, and interact with reactive surroundings.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Built-in Map System</strong>: Players must mark trails with chalk, promoting true exploration and self-reliance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tool Management &amp; Gear Maintenance</strong>: Navigate the darkness using ropes and a headlamp. Maintain your gloves to ensure their reliability.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Climbing Mechanics</strong>: Climb any surface using pitons, choosing your own routes—no predefined climbing paths.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breath Management System</strong>: Manage your breathing in tight passages. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obstacle Interaction</strong>: Use tools to break stalactites, remove debris, and clear blockages in the cave system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929970/extras/575329d10c27ba004f8d9c3bb7174240.avif?t=1789043920\" width=728 height=290 /></span></p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Face your fears in realistic VR spelunking. Explore fictional and real-life caves recreated in VR, including the infamous Nutty Putty cave guided by a real-life rescuer. Tackle steep climbs and narrow tunnels with physical tools and authentic techniques.",
